.alert.alert-light.border.mb-0
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Compare private ratings side by side, talk through gaps, and award official milestone levels one ability at a time.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render 'shared/maap/definition'

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Only people who can award milestones (same as Celebrate / bulk award eligibility) set the official level.
    %li Awarding 1–5 creates the milestone records (filling lower levels as needed). Awarding 0 leaves the ability “new” for future calibration.
    %li You can award abilities one by one; you do not have to finish the whole set in one submit.
